@startuml Feature12_Seq_1
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam minClassWidth 100

title **Feature 12: Interview Scheduling - Sequence: Book a Session**

actor Recruiter
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "<<controller>>\nInterviewScheduleController" as Ctrl
participant "<<service>>\nInterviewScheduleService" as Svc
participant "<<repository>>\nSchedulingRepository" as Repo
participant "<<service>>\nNotificationService" as Notify
participant "Database" as DB

Recruiter -> UI: Phones interviewer & candidate, agrees a time
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/applications/{id}/interviews
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: BookAsync(companyId, userId, applicationId, dto)
activate Svc

note right of Svc: Application must be at INTERVIEW\n(the department manager approved it)

note right of Svc: Validate: job has approved criteria,\npanel 1..5, time in the future,\nround number not skipping ahead

Svc -> Repo: FindCandidateBusyAtAsync / FindBusyInterviewerAsync
activate Repo
Repo --> Svc: return conflict or null
deactivate Repo

Svc -> Repo: ManualConfirmAsync(...)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: INSERT pool (CLOSED) + slot (BOOKED) + panel + schedule (CONFIRMED)
activate DB
DB --> Repo: success
deactivate DB
Repo --> Svc: return scheduleId
deactivate Repo

Svc -> Notify: SendInterviewConfirmedAsync(...)
activate Notify
note right of Notify: Confirmation email + .ics\n(best effort)
Notify --> Svc: ok
deactivate Notify

Svc --> Ctrl: return scheduleId
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: return JSON { scheduleId }
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Recruiter: Session saved, candidate notified
deactivate UI
@enduml
